<title>POLAND: Kety H1 net falls to PLN 14.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Kety H1 net falls to PLN 14.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kety SA preliminary results for the first six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    H1 1996	H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating			     22.18   vs   24.43</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 26.00   vs   23.98</p>
<p>    net				     14.87   vs   17.43</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    185.26   vs  193.66</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     146.88   vs  153.11</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00   vs    0.47 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			    11.13   vs    6.24</p>
<p>    other taxes				 -   vs    0.31</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   9.27   vs    1.94</p>
<p>    financial costs			5.48   vs    1.91</p>
<p>    investment			    93.48   vs    5.39</p>
<p>    depreciation			   3.15   vs    2.92</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
